nt wrong.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6GkY0WDk7pAZ1jzlAGspnrKPoqH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjUvTWVsby1Nb3ZpZS0yMDI1Lw.1.8","title":"All You Need Is Love","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2025-02-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As Gyeom pretends to be okay, his loved ones worry for his well-being. But soon, Mubee helps him find the courage to confront his feelings.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5yc4iU8ScGnhodcSebn7YiPHH7N.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjUvTWVsby1Nb3ZpZS0yMDI1Lw.1.9","title":"We Were Like Strangers Who Knew Each Other Very Well","season":1,"episode":9,"released":"2025-02-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Si-jun and Ju-a wrestle with their emotions as they question their future. Meanwhile, Mubee's film encounters a hurdle, leaving her feeling at a loss.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cSX6g9OgUd3nUW5gRy9ofz2xXf7.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjUvTWVsby1Nb3ZpZS0yMDI1Lw.1.10","title":"Life Is a Beautiful, Magnificent Thing, Even to a Jellyfish","season":1,"episode":10,"released":"2025-02-14T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Shedding their past, Mubee and Gyeom resolve to live their life to the fullest. Si-jun and Ju-a make a final decision about their relationship.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fFMaUo3jpz6WsYZvSSrScBdYz4L.jpg"}]}}